SELECT 3028,1,'<visitor-final@factory>','Jiaxing Smart Manufacturing: final visitor notice (please relay to everyone)','security@factory.example.invalid','["wei.ran@example.invalid"]','[]','[]','2026-07-19T08:45:00+08:00','Schedule: register at the gate and collect a visitor badge at 08:40; a 20-minute safety briefing starts at 09:00; then enter the workshop in two groups. The stamping area is continuously loud, so everyone must wear earplugs. The grinding area is dusty; wear a mask and pass quickly. The forklift lane is bounded by a yellow line and may never be crossed. No photography in the customer prototype area; the lobby group-photo point is allowed. Raise a hand if unwell and a safety officer will escort you to a rest area; no reason is required.','',0,1,1,'{}',3028,520,'2026-07-19T00:45:00Z'
